/* Platform UI resources, ported from Anomaly's cmake/platform_ui_resources.rc.in.
 *
 * 101 RCDATA -- the platform logo.  src/ui/platform_host.cpp reads it back with
 *               FindResourceW(&__ImageBase, MAKEINTRESOURCEW(kPlatformLogoResourceId), ...)
 *               and draws it as the host header logo, both through the standalone D3D11 host
 *               (CreateStandaloneHeaderLogo) and through the game's resource backend.
 *               Embedded at 32x32 because that is the size it is displayed at: upstream feeds
 *               this same slot from logo-header.png.
 *
 * The absolute path is injected by CMake's configure_file(@ONLY) from file(TO_CMAKE_PATH ...),
 * because rc.exe resolves relative paths against its own working directory.
 *
 * Upstream's second entry, 102 (the ESC-menu logo, read back by LoadNteEscMenuLogoBytes in
 * src/runtime/core_main.cpp), is deliberately absent: it is one of the NTE-specific designs this
 * migration excludes, it has no reader here at all, and embedding a megabyte of bytes nothing
 * reads would be dead weight in an image that is manually mapped into the game process.
 */
101 RCDATA "@CABBIRD_PLATFORM_LOGO_PATH@"
